# Two people talk about the hero and look at each other (docs/npc-tools.md, wave 2 step 2), with an AI server
# (GOTHIC_AI_URL) whose scenario stages them (`serve --scenario gossip_demo --llm off --no-tts`): Lobart has
# caught the hero lying, Hilda is put 5 m from him (NW_FARM1_PATH_01), the hero 7 m from them; Lobart turns
# to her and they say three lines in turn, each to the other. During each line both should show `look=talk
# at=<the other>` (`nearby`, `pair`), the watched Hilda's `gaze err` within 15 degrees, and the frames of the
# sheet show them facing each other. The game's own lines and SVMs of anyone around are `output` in bench.log.
cheat god
goto NW_FARM1_OUT_01
watch BAU_951_HILDA
view clean 60
wait 6000
cam follow 450 110 90   # from her left side: her profile, Lobart in front of her
cam look 150
rec gossip
nearby 2500
pair BAU_950_LOBART BAU_951_HILDA
where BAU_951_HILDA NW_FARM1_PATH_01
wait 1000
nearby 2500
pair BAU_950_LOBART BAU_951_HILDA
where BAU_951_HILDA NW_FARM1_PATH_01
wait 1000
